paragraph start
todo: broot and file management: Decided, order: files and dirs are never numbered by hand and their names carry no numbers. The order is held by the introduction of each dir as an ordered list of its children. Numbers are computed from position. The order is changed in a tree view, like a tree file manager, by moving an entry up, down, in or out, and the tree view rewrites the lists. The lists stay plain text, so the files stay the truth.
Planned.
