paragraph start
todo: broot step 5: guard in the build. A build.rs in broot and in
every shell crate that step 8 lists scans src for fs::remove,
rename, create_dir, copy, write, set_permissions, File::create,
OpenOptions, trash::, symlink and Command::new. Any hit outside the
allow list fails the build with file and line. The allow list is one
